strengths.value:
As far as I can tell, the strengths of the paper include:

* The development of the proposed causal TD and causal eligibility traces algorithms, which appear novel;
* The proposed causal Bellman equations, which may provide practitioners with valuable insights into the value or Q-functions, especially in scenarios involving unmeasured confounders;
* The main text of the paper is technically sound. I did not review the Appendix, but I did not spot any errors in the main text;
* The writing is generally clear.

